{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50786","headline":"题江陵崔兵曹林亭 · 张祜","name":"题江陵崔兵曹林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小隐蜀江边，重峦尽一川。\n山形分断岸，水势尽平田。\n嫩碧生栏浅，轻红落砌蔫。\n短桥扶竹过，欹路把藤缘。\n南巷纤埃隔，东郊远思延。\n月庭潜润石，风渚自移舡。\n滴露蒲光冷，摇波柳翠鲜。\n关心每来胜，幸尔必相然。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50786.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50786","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}